                                                "sense_id": "d69a2678-f229-3db5-a34f-507745039a96",
                                                "text": "\"As how, my lambkin,\" blushing, she replide, / \"Because I in this dancing schoole abide? / If that it be, that breede's this discontent, / We will remoue the camp incontinent: / For shelter onelie, sweete heart, came I hither, / And to auoide the troblous stormie weather; / But now the coaste is cleare, we will be gonne, / Since, but thy self, true louer I haue none.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d584c9c-fa05-4a55-82a7-3152af8d470f",
                                                "sense_id": "d69a2678-f229-3db5-a34f-507745039a96",
                                                "text": "He says he will return incontinent:"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incontinent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
